  {
    "__type__": "cc.RichText",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "node": {
      "__id__": 300
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "__prefab": {
      "__id__": 302
    },
    "_lineHeight": 22,
    "_string": "<color=#5e2802>VIP for specify price offers a subscription, gets Spins, Food and Card everyday. This is an <color=#203d9b><u><on click=\"handle\" param=\"sub\">Auto-renewing-subscription</on></u></c>. Payment is charged to phone Account at confirmation. <color=#5e2802>Subcription is renewed unless turned off 24h before the period ends, account will be charged for renewal as well.</c> You may turn it off in your Account Settings. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable. <color=#203d9b><u><on click=\"handle\" param=\"pri\">Privacy Policy and Terms of Use</on></u></c>.</c>",
    "_horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_fontSize": 20,
    "_maxWidth": 510,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_font": {
      "__uuid__": "dc937665-0ad5-40ba-9353-302a24a58f53"
